# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token (Cloudflare dashboard → Analytics &
# Logs → Web Analytics → your site → "Manage site" → the `token` value).
# Set this in Vercel under Settings → Environment Variables. It is baked into
# the static build, so a change only takes effect after a redeploy. Leave it
# unset and no beacon script is emitted.
PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
